NAME
    type - Display the textual contents of a file in the console. Binary control bytes are made safe for console output.

SYNOPSIS
    type <file_name>

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Display the textual contents of a file in the console. Binary control bytes are made safe for console output.

EXAMPLES
    type README.TXT

FILES
    /System/Commands/TYPE.CMD
    /INU/HELP/TYPE.MAN
